    "detailed_description": "<h1>ALSO RECOMMENDED FOR YOU</h1><p><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443520/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1707321332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443520/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1707321332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443520/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1707321332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>\ud83d\ude38 A portion of the profit from this game will be allocated to street cat rescue and support initiatives. \ud83d\ude3b<br><br>Purrfect Rescue is a hidden object game where you need to find cats in urban scenarios. There are 5 different scenarios, each with 101 cats to be found. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443520/extras/c6460e6f61bf15126c1768b5607a4b5a.poster.avif?t=1707321332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443520/extras/c6460e6f61bf15126c1768b5607a4b5a.webm?t=1707321332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443520/extras/c6460e6f61bf15126c1768b5607a4b5a.mp4?t=1707321332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br>\u200b\ud83c\udfb5\u200b Original soundtrack.<br>\ud83d\udc3e 5 different scenarios.<br>\ud83d\udc08 505 cats to find.<br>\ud83d\ude3a 5 special cats with their rescue stories.<br>\ud83e\udde9 Game experience designed for both think and relax.",
    "about_the_game": "\ud83d\ude38 A portion of the profit from this game will be allocated to street cat rescue and support initiatives. \ud83d\ude3b<br><br>Purrfect Rescue is a hidden object game where you need to find cats in urban scenarios. There are 5 different scenarios, each with 101 cats to be found. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443520/extras/c6460e6f61bf15126c1768b5607a4b5a.poster.avif?t=1707321332\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443520/extras/c6460e6f61bf15126c1768b5607a4b5a.webm?t=1707321332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443520/extras/c6460e6f61bf15126c1768b5607a4b5a.mp4?t=1707321332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br>\u200b\ud83c\udfb5\u200b Original soundtrack.<br>\ud83d\udc3e 5 different scenarios.<br>\ud83d\udc08 505 cats to find.<br>\ud83d\ude3a 5 special cats with their rescue stories.<br>\ud83e\udde9 Game experience designed for both think and relax.",
